## Design state

The user requested all design artifacts together, followed by a short process
overview. After review and the arbiter's successful recheck, the user asked
to validate structure and finish design. That instruction accepts the current
six-artifact bundle for structural validation.

The approved design is a large architectural development: coordination,
participation, proposal ownership, and context boundaries require independent
decisions. It adds REQ-008 for scope-appropriate design contexts and REQ-009
for delegation of design participation.

